<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine grain/oilseed stocks on August 1.</title>
<headline>Argentine grain/oilseed stocks on August 1.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine Agriculture Secretariat figures for domestic grain stocks on August 1 in tonnes, followed by figures for a month earlier and a year earlier:</p>
<p> Bread wheat    2,118,270	 2,642,562	 1,927,090</p>
<p> Durum wheat	    n/a		 n/a		 n/a</p>
<p> Maize	    2,939,697	 3,236,123	 2,578,247</p>
<p> Sorghum	    197,727	   240,947	   224,990</p>
<p> Barley	     158,782	   173,902	   111,727</p>
